    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:1rem; color:var(--white-dim); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
          Foust Brothers LLC — Digital Division is a local web services operation built on one principle: do the work right, say what you'll do, then do what you said. No inflated promises. No mystery invoices. No auto-billing.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:1rem; color:var(--white-dim); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
          We operate like a master-level shop — every project is treated as a work order, every client is treated like a long-term partner. Whether you need a simple landing page or a full multi-page architecture, we bring the same level of precision and honesty to the build.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:1rem; color:var(--white-dim); line-height:1.8;">
          Based locally in North Carolina, we work with small businesses, contractors, and entrepreneurs who need a reliable digital presence without the agency runaround.
        </p>

        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="about-stat">
            <span class="about-stat-value">99.9%</span>
