      <div>
        <div class="section-module-label" style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><div class="section-dot"></div> OPERATING VALUES</div>

        <div class="about-values">
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-title">UNDER PROMISE, OVER DELIVER</div>
            <div class="value-desc">We set realistic expectations and then exceed them. Every time. This is not a marketing tagline — it's our standard operating procedure.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-title">TRANSPARENT BILLING</div>
            <div class="value-desc">Manual invoices only. You see exactly what you're paying for before any charge is made. No subscriptions, no auto-billing, no surprises.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-title">LOCAL & RELIABLE</div>
            <div class="value-desc">We're not an agency on the other side of the country. We're local, reachable, and accountable. Your project matters to us personally.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-title">PERFORMANCE-BASED</div>
            <div class="value-desc">We don't get paid until the work is done right. Our commitment is tied to results, not just deliverables.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-title">NO FLUFF, NO PRESSURE</div>
            <div class="value-desc">We give honest assessments. If your project doesn't need something, we'll tell you. We'd rather keep a client long-term than oversell a project short-term.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
